1
00:00:00,920 --> 00:00:02,630
(Leonard:)No, no-no-no, I'm ready!

2
00:00:02,640 --> 00:00:05,150
(Leonard:)I gave up the gift of
sight for you.

3
00:00:05,150 --> 00:00:06,790
(Leonard:)If that's not moving on,
what is?

4
00:00:06,790 --> 00:00:10,060
(Priya:)You need to cut the cord
with Penny.

5
00:00:10,060 --> 00:00:12,430
(Leonard:)Oh... okay.

6
00:00:12,430 --> 00:00:14,760
(Priya:)You don't sound very confident.

7
00:00:14,760 --> 00:00:16,360
(Leonard:)No, no, I'm confident.

8
00:00:16,370 --> 00:00:18,800
Its not like I'm unfamiliar with
the "get lost" conversation.

9
00:00:18,800 --> 00:00:21,940
(Leonard:)Although, this will be the first
time I'll be the one saying it.

10
00:00:21,940 --> 00:00:24,110
(Sheldon:)Thank you.

11
00:00:24,110 --> 00:00:25,440
(Priya:)I appreciate it.

12
00:00:25,440 --> 00:00:26,710
(Priya:)Sure.

13
00:00:26,710 --> 00:00:29,180
(Leonard:)Oh, God, you
smell so good.

14
00:00:29,180 --> 00:00:31,210
(Leonard:)Of course, that
could just be

15
00:00:31,210 --> 00:00:33,130
(Leonard:)my other senses
getting stronger.

16
00:00:36,190 --> 00:00:40,190
(Leonard:)Hypothetically, if I had access

17
00:00:40,190 --> 00:00:44,790
(Leonard:)to a Lieutenant Uhura uniform,
would you wear it?

18
00:00:44,790 --> 00:00:47,030
(Priya:)Leonard, it is a source
of great pain

19
00:00:47,030 --> 00:00:48,160
(Priya:)to me and my family

20
00:00:48,160 --> 00:00:50,330
(Priya:)that my brother has that outfit
in his wardrobe.

21
00:00:50,330 --> 00:00:51,830
(Priya:)Can we not discuss it?

22
00:00:51,830 --> 00:00:54,600
I'm sorry. Never mind.

23
00:00:58,740 --> 00:01:00,540
(Howard:)And was your card the jack
of diamonds?

